OL,3,CChanges introduced on 16th June
OL,4,C
OL,5,FTheGRadio GuideFindexed onGP200Fnow has
OL,6,Fexpanded coverage of national BBC and
OL,7,Fcommercial stations.
OL,9,FA number of additionalGBBC Local Radio
OL,10,Fstations are also now available in the
OL,11,GRegional Radio GuideFonGP250.FMore
OL,12,Fstations will be added soon.
OL,14,FEarlier in the day, in preparation for
OL,15,Fthe expansion of the radio section,
OL,16,Fpage numbers within theGRegional Sport
OL,17,Fsection were updated.
OL,19,FSimilar changes were made to theGTV
OL,20,GGuideFandGRegional NewsFsections over
OL,21,Fthe weekend. Page numbers for regional
OL,22,Fnews and sport now align once again.
